## Essential Invariants
- No hardcoded `localhost`/`127.0.0.1`/DB strings/keys/passwords. Always `os.getenv("KEY", "default")`.
- Base images: `slim-bookworm` only. Never Alpine.
- `compose.yaml` includes `platform: linux/amd64` for all build services.
- Health endpoints test real deps (e.g. `await db.execute("SELECT 1")`).
- CHANGELOG entry required for any code/config/infra change (format in `50-code-review.md`).
- DB schema → Alembic migrations only (raw SQL DDL banned per `25-data-postgres.md`); `db/schema.sql` is reference only.
- `.env.example` updated when adding env vars.
- Ports: Python 8000–8099, Frontend 3000–3099. Register in `PORTS.md` before use.
- No `/tmp/` — use project `.tmp/`.
- No class-level config — function-level only.
- **Naming: kebab-case.** Exceptions: `README.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, `INDEX.md`, `PORTS.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `AGENTS-compact.md`, `LESSONS_LEARNT.md`, `Makefile`, `Dockerfile`, Python pkgs (snake_case), auto-generated, dotfiles.
- Docker port security: never expose container ports via `ports:`. Traefik handles external. Docker bypasses UFW; DOCKER-USER iptables enforces. See `30-ops.md`.
- Service auth (4 layers): iptables → Authelia (admin 2FA) → `X-Internal-Token` (API m2m) → Traefik (public). New admin dashboards add `authelia-forward@docker`. New API services validate `X-Internal-Token`.

## Sensitive Data Protection
Before modifying `.env`/`*.key`/`*.pem`/`secrets/`/`.ssh/`:
```bash
cp <file> <file>.backup.$(date +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S)
```
No backup = STOP.

## Before Creating New Scripts
grep_search scripts/ and scripts/enforcement/ first. Extend existing code; don't duplicate.

## PEP 668: Venv
NEVER bare pip install (fails "externally-managed-environment"). Use /opt/<project>/.venv/bin/pip install <pkg>.

## Password Policy
32 chars, [a-zA-Z0-9], secrets.choice(). Forbidden: postgres, admin, password123.

## Decision-Grade Audit (before reporting done)
- Error handling: silent/misleading/brittle failures handled?
- Complexity: any "debugging footgun" in 6 months?
- One-Test Rule: propose exactly ONE test (highest risk reduction). Document Why + Given/When/Then + mocked vs real. In plan file or commit msg.

For mechanical checks and gate commands, see 50-code-review.md.
